        <text>
          <content>
            <paragraph align="center">○<index num="1247306_0" sort="K" type="지명">全羅</index>兵使<index num="1247307_0" ref="M_0017792" sort="K" type="이름">金俊龍</index>, 領兵入援軍<index num="1247308_0" sort="K" type="지명">光敎山</index>,<annotation type="원주">
                <noteContent>【<index num="1247309_0" sort="K" type="지명">京圻</index>
                  <index num="1247310_0" sort="K" type="지명">水原</index>、<index num="1247311_0" sort="K" type="지명">龍仁</index>之間。】</noteContent>
              </annotation>馳啓戰勝前進之狀。 時, <index num="1247312_0" sort="K" type="지명">南漢</index>被圍已久, 內外隔絶。 至是, 援兵聲息繼至, 城中恃以爲固。</paragraph>
